    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/5ff759f6ff4d608a348592f9b5fdc01c.avif?t=1754644865\" /></span>Daemonium is a 1-4 player online co-op psychological horror game. Demonic possessions are running rampant. Grab your equipment, join your team, and locate the source of the demonic presence. Enter the portal to the demon realm to stop the possession once and for all. Perform an exorcism and banish the entity to hell before it claims your soul.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>- &quot;One of the best rituals in any ghost hunting game&quot;</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/1f8e7b92daf23d1144ba47a3611e141c.avif?t=1754644865\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can play in a wide variety of locations as well as a selection of demon realms which are chosen randomly each game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/ba9ebcdf7becdccc7c51104346d822e2.poster.avif?t=1754644865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/ba9ebcdf7becdccc7c51104346d822e2.webm?t=1754644865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/ba9ebcdf7becdccc7c51104346d822e2.mp4?t=1754644865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/e780ad9b3595fd1a1f5332f006195061.avif?t=1754644865\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play together with up to 4 player teams</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/multiplayer.gif?t=1754644865\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/1cf7108bec0125e38baa34fcf6dacd11.avif?t=1754644865\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide range of equipment to find evidence of paranormal activity and reveal the possessed item<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/8adf631dbf701eb79ab38d7431693d99.poster.avif?t=1754644865\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/8adf631dbf701eb79ab38d7431693d99.webm?t=1754644865\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/8adf631dbf701eb79ab38d7431693d99.mp4?t=1754644865\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327140/extras/1c57e731e6e41637ed9b62cda8eaaf47.avif?t=1754644865\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove possessed items from the locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"ht